        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/60e0b14409d1626b526df1b12b42fb6c.webp?t=1759147765\" width=31 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/04bccd398688ff1d3f9376a608e23abc.webp?t=1759147765\" width=57 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/2299da42d0c9497715476a52c381c7cd.webp?t=1759147765\" width=38 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/346541ab6a20a3601e63a7315db1ab22.webp?t=1759147765\" width=51 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit Amborettio, Wanech established a command post for <strong>Wanech’s Z.O.O. (Zoological Outreach Operation)</strong>. The HQ hums with chiptune pings—retro, cozy, and just a little heroic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this top-down <strong>clicker-typer</strong> with arcade bursts, you’ll <strong>rescue animals and grow habitats</strong>. Type the 3-letter prompts to complete rescues, <strong>click</strong> falling pickups for bonus <strong>Fish/Leaves</strong>, and <strong>trade</strong> resources into SCORE. Invest in upgrades to automate income and <strong>obtain Marine Prestige and Forest Prestige to further unlock achievements</strong>—then watch your sanctuary come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody’s sure why Wanech swapped dungeons for dens—some say it’s all to protect the creatures of Amborettio. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: <strong>expand the Z.O.O., stack upgrades, and chase a flood of achievements</strong>, with chiptunes chirping and the rescues never stopping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/60e0b14409d1626b526df1b12b42fb6c.webp?t=1759147765\" width=31 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/04bccd398688ff1d3f9376a608e23abc.webp?t=1759147765\" width=57 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/2299da42d0c9497715476a52c381c7cd.webp?t=1759147765\" width=38 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/346541ab6a20a3601e63a7315db1ab22.webp?t=1759147765\" width=51 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit Amborettio, Wanech established a command post for <strong>Wanech’s Z.O.O. (Zoological Outreach Operation)</strong>. The HQ hums with chiptune pings—retro, cozy, and just a little heroic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this top-down <strong>clicker-typer</strong> with arcade bursts, you’ll <strong>rescue animals and grow habitats</strong>. Type the 3-letter prompts to complete rescues, <strong>click</strong> falling pickups for bonus <strong>Fish/Leaves</strong>, and <strong>trade</strong> resources into SCORE. Invest in upgrades to automate income and <strong>obtain Marine Prestige and Forest Prestige to further unlock achievements</strong>—then watch your sanctuary come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody’s sure why Wanech swapped dungeons for dens—some say it’s all to protect the creatures of Amborettio. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: <strong>expand the Z.O.O., stack upgrades, and chase a flood of achievements</strong>, with chiptunes chirping and the rescues never stopping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>",
        "short_description": "Rescue animals for Wanech’s Z.O.O. in a clicker-typer with arcade bursts. Type 3-letter prompts, click falling pickups and trade Fish/Leaves into SCORE. Upgrade automation, earn Marine &amp; Forest Prestige, unlock heaps of achievements, and keep the sanctuary humming to chiptune pings nonstop.",
